ing coffee. She has curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses, and a mustard-yellow knit sweater; render all these solely as grayscale values appropriate to CCTV. A croissant rests on a little paper bag on the coffee-machine counter beside her. Unflattering surveillance perspective, compressed low-resolution analog detail, monochrome noisy shadows, flat fluorescent lighting, ghosting and subtle scan-line interference, edges blurred. Genuine security recording, no portrait staging, no cinematic lighting. A small timestamp-overlay-like strip near the top contains ONLY indecipherable pale pixel segments and electronic noise, no readable digits or letters. The square output should look like a low resolution surveillance frame enlarged, never a polished photograph with an overlay. No readable text, captions, signatures, watermarks, logos or brands anywhere.\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"/Users/manuelbieh/.codex/generated_images/01a0e992-9ab5-7d71-a281-1f5e057e5527/exec-b7c94c03-493d-49da-a608-8890d36ec741.png\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"215-polaroid\\\",\\\"prompt\\\":\\\"Generate ONE fresh image from text only, no reference images. Square 1024x1024. A tactile nostalgic Polaroid instant photograph, with an authentic off-white physical frame and notably thicker BLANK bottom border, lying slightly askew on a wooden cafe table next to a real ceramic coffee cup. The Polaroid occupies most of the square composition, the nearby coffee cup is partly visible outside the print. In the instant photograph itself is an intimate side-profile medium-wide seated scene: a woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater, curled comfortably into a cafe window seat, gently sipping her coffee and looking out the window, a croissant on a saucer beside her. Instant-film image has washed-out warm colors, milky shadow tones, slightly faded yellow and auburn, soft focus, imperfect organic exposure and gentle emulsion bloom; a lived-in casual instant memory. Frame edges and its cast shadow must make the physical print believable, thick bottom margin clean and empty. Let instant-photo materiality and the nested photo-on-table composition dominate. No readable text, no writing on the frame, no captions, digits, signatures, watermarks or logos.\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"/Users/manuelbieh/.codex/generated_images/01a0e992-9ab5-7d71-a281-1f5e057e5527/exec-756a8265-b248-4038-ace9-8e9cb2d33140.png\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"216-cyanotype\\\",\\\"prompt\\\":\\\"Generate ONE fresh image from text only, no reference images. Square 1024x1024. An authentic handmade CYANOTYPE SUN PRINT on textured watercolor paper, exclusively deep Prussian blue and paper white with intermediate exposure blues. This is a flat contact print / photogram artwork, not a photograph of a woman with a blue filter. A poetic large side-profile silhouette of a woman in her early 30s, curly shoulder-length hair and distinctive round glasses, lifting a coffee cup to enjoy its aroma and sip; a small croissant silhouette on a saucer nearby is incorporated into the lower composition. Her underlying character has auburn curls, freckles, tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knitted sweater, but these are interpreted entirely through the cyanotype medium: white curly hair contour, glasses rings, sparse negative freckles, and a few contact-exposed knit-texture impressions inside a boldly simplified blue-and-white figure. Arrange overlapping real botanical leaves and fern fronds as ghostly photogram silhouettes across and around her bust and cup, delicate veins, irregular exposure halos, broad Prussian-blue negative space. Visible cold-pressed paper fibers, uneven hand-brushed sensitizer edges with rough blue brushmarks stopping short of bare white paper margins, tiny natural chemical variations. Flattened elegant silhouette geometry and paper chemistry dictate anatomy and proportions. No full-color details, no conventional photographic shading, no framing prop, no readable text, captions, signatures, watermarks, letters or digits.\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"/Users/manuelbieh/.codex/generated_images/01a0e992-9ab5-7d71-a281-1f5e057e5527/exec-3f9f8b0a-bb21-466e-8e4e-8769ec43d0ac.png\\\"}]\")
